                                           :elucidation "A single phase mixture."@en ;
                                           :wikipediaReference <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mixture#Homogeneous_and_heterogeneous_mixtures> .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo#EMMO_11a7a5f9_fcbd_45d0_b95f_8f0014becc31
